This extension adds Dragon Age: The Veilguard modding support to Vortex Mod Manager.
[summary]Frosty Mod Manager automatically installed.[/summary]

[size=3][color=#ffff00]This extension will automatically download, install, and check for updates to [/color][url=https://github.com/J-Lyt/FrostyToolsuite/releases]Frosty Mod Manager[/url][color=#ffff00]. You will need to do some setup, including acquiring an encryption key, before you can use Frosty to install mods.[/color][/size]
[list]
[*][b][size=3][color=#00ff00][size=3][b]Installation Guide: [url=https://docs.google.com/document/d/1F6X8fjh6RS_IHX7cqx36lyhCEpLPZSYknki-M28w_K0/edit?tab=t.0]https://docs.google.com/document/d/1F6X8fjh6RS_IHX7cqx36lyhCEpLPZSYknki-M28w_K0/edit?tab=t.0[/url][/b][/size][/color][/size][/b][/*]
[/list]

[b]✅ Supported Versions:[/b]
[list]
[*]Steam[/*]
[*]Epic[/*]
[*]EA[/*]
[*]Other versions may need to select the installation location manually.[/*]
[/list]
[size=3][b][color=#ea9999]This game does not support symlinks. You must have the mod staging folder and the game on the same drive to use this extension.[/color][/b][/size]

[b]🛠️ Mod Installation Notes:[/b]
[list]
[*]Frosty Mod Manager installs to the "FrostyModManager" folder, recognised by a "frostymodmanager.exe" file.[/*]
[*]DAVExtender mods with a "d3d11.dll" file install to the game folder.[/*]
[*]SDK Patch (EA/Epic) mods with a "DragonAgeTheVeilguardSDK.dll" file install to the "FrostyModManager\Profiles" folder.[/*]
[*]Frosty mods with a ".fbmod" file install to the "FrostyModManager\Mods\Dragon Age The Veilguard" folder.[/*]
[*]Archives with a FOMOD installer (a "fomod" folder with ModuleConfig.xml) are handed to Vortex's built-in FOMOD installer instead.[/*]
[/list]
[b]📋 Usage Notes:[/b]
[list]
[*]You can open several useful files/folders/URLs using the buttons within the folder icon on the Mods toolbar.[/*]
[*]Frostbite Engine mods (.fbmods) will be installed to the default folder that Frosty Mod Manager uses. So basically, this extension allows you to download mods from Nexus and pass them directly to Frosty MM in the correct folder, so you don't have to move files around manually.[/*]
[*]Automatically installs the required [url=https://github.com/J-Lyt/FrostyToolsuite/releases]Frosty SDK patch[/url]﻿ for the EA version of the game. Epic support not available since I don't own that version, and need user help to find a file that is unique to that version. [color=#f6b26b]New versions can be downloaded using the button shown in the screenshot below.[/color][/*]
[*][size=2][url=https://github.com/J-Lyt/FrostyToolsuite/releases]Frosty Mod Manager[/url]﻿ will be automatically downloaded, installed, and checked for updates from GitHub when running update checks.[/size][/*]
[*][size=2]You must have Steam and/or EA App open when launching the game from Vortex in order for mods to load and the game to start.[/size][/*]
[/list]

[size=4]Links:[/size]
[list]
